--- FOR Loop Tester ---
Iterating over list: ["apple", "banana", "STOP", "cherry", "date"]
--- Test 1: Full Iteration ---
Item: apple
Item: banana
Item: STOP
Item: cherry
Item: date
--- Test 2: FOR loop with BREAK ---
Looping until we find 'STOP'...
Item: apple
Item: banana
Found STOP, breaking loop.
--- Test 3: FOR loop with CONTINUE ---
Looping, but skipping 'STOP'...
Item: apple
Item: banana
(Skipping an item)
Item: cherry
Item: date
--- Test 4: Local C-Style FOR Loop ---
Local I: 0 | Local I: 1 | Local I: 2 | Local I: 3 | Local I: 4 | 

--- Test 5: Global C-Style FOR Loop ---
Global X inside loop: 0
Global X inside loop: 1
Global X inside loop: 2
Global X outside loop: 3

